Package: iasi.quarto
Type: Package
Title: Build System for Quarto Publications
Version: 0.5.1
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Javier",
    family = "G. Grandez",
    email = "jggrandez@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Discovers, validates, builds, and renders Quarto publications
    from their project structure. The package recognizes structured, regular,
    and direct publication models, generates the Quarto artifacts required by
    each model, and keeps construction separate from rendering.
